# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to run `wrangler dev`.
#
# That is the entire local configuration — one line. The three Access values
# (CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN, CF_ACCESS_AUD, ADMIN_EMAILS) are NOT needed locally and
# should never be put here: nothing sits in front of `wrangler dev`, so there is
# no assertion to verify. access.ts takes the bypass below instead.
#
# The literal string is required — any other value falls through to the real
# verification path and every request 503s.
#
# Never move this key into wrangler.jsonc. That file IS deployed, and it would
# disable the gate in production.
DEV_UNSAFE_SKIP_ACCESS=i-am-running-wrangler-dev
